# ── DATA IS NOT PUBLISHED ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships CODE + NOTEBOOKS + manifest ONLY.
# Every dataset (raw sources AND the derived per-CFTR score extracts) is
# license-restricted / non-commercial and must NOT be redistributed here:
#   SpliceAI  CC BY-NC 4.0 · REVEL non-commercial · PrimateAI/dbNSFP CC BY-NC-ND
